* RECARR
* A record as a nested array, and back (the one-editor plan, stage 1, 26 Oct 2026): the way a multivalue record is shown and edited by CED in its data mode (ced_edit,
* ftype 2), so that nobody types a value or a subvalue mark.  And, the same day, the TOKEN FORM: a record as text in which the marks are written as @vm, @sm and @tm.
